=== Binary-Ternary Bridge Demo ===

Ternary value: +1 -1  0 +1 -1  (decimal 56)

Encoding to binary (2 bits per trit):
  trit[0] = + → bits (+,0)  valid=true
  trit[1] = - → bits (0,+)  valid=true
  trit[2] = 0 → bits (0,0)  valid=true
  trit[3] = + → bits (+,0)  valid=true
  trit[4] = - → bits (0,+)  valid=true

Total: 5 trits encoded as 10 binary bits
Binary: 10 01 00 10 01

Decoding back to ternary:
  Round-trip: 5/5 trits match

Invalid encoding (1,1) → 0 (mapped to 0)

=== Bridge demo complete ===
